OL,3,GNEWSAPlaid demands more cash, but how
OL,4,Acould the Budget affect Wales?
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlaid Cymru ministers say they want
OL,7,Fextra cash for railways and public
OL,8,Fservices in Wales ahead of the UK
OL,9,Fgovernment's Budget on Wednesday.
OL,11,FWelsh Finance Minister Elin Jones
OL,12,Fcalled for the Chancellor John Healey
OL,13,Fto set out a spending plan that
OL,14,F"finally treats us fairly".
OL,16,FThe Budget announces Westminster's tax
OL,17,Fand spending plans for the year ahead -
OL,18,Fand more cash given to English public
OL,19,Fservices could result in extra spending
OL,20,Fin Wales where they are devolved.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
